{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20211",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.85,
      "end_seconds": 6.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Hello, take a seat, I'll be with you in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.04,
      "end_seconds": 8.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Hi, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 10.12,
      "end_seconds": 13.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.47,
      "end_seconds": 17.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "What's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 18.98,
      "end_seconds": 24.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Doctor, um, it's drenching night sweats. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.29,
      "end_seconds": 28.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.14,
      "end_seconds": 41.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "that's it, just a little longer.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.15,
      "end_seconds": 74.02,
      "duration_seconds": 16.87,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to 28.6, oxygen saturation is 98 percent. And pulse is 88 beats a minute, height 163 centimetres, weight 76 kilos, BP is 122 over 72. How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.07,
      "end_seconds": 78.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Probably ten days. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.87,
      "end_seconds": 82.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "What do you do to make it better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.41,
      "end_seconds": 89.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "Only changing my clothes, uh, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.08,
      "end_seconds": 94.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "so, is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.83,
      "end_seconds": 97.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "I'd call it mild"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.01,
      "end_seconds": 104.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.94,
      "end_seconds": 120.87,
      "duration_seconds": 14.93,
      "text": "Itching all over goes along with it, most of the time. I've also had a lump in my armpit, for ten days. The The Itching all over? That's been for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.49,
      "end_seconds": 137.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Did you get recent travel, diarrhoea, weight loss or joint pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.9,
      "end_seconds": 141.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.26,
      "end_seconds": 144.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Okay, any sign of chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.63,
      "end_seconds": 150.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Well, I haven't noticed any chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.78,
      "end_seconds": 153.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.72,
      "end_seconds": 157.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "no, all normal there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.12,
      "end_seconds": 163.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.02,
      "end_seconds": 166.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "no changes there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.4,
      "end_seconds": 170.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.72,
      "end_seconds": 174.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "no, not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.49,
      "end_seconds": 178.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "right, tell me your medicines, please"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.75,
      "end_seconds": 187.22,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "I'm on rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night. It's lisinopril, 10 milligrams, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.83,
      "end_seconds": 190.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Is that long-standing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.53,
      "end_seconds": 202.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.53,
      "text": "For two years. It's metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for the heart rhythm. Dolo. I take it when I get the fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.26,
      "end_seconds": 205.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.47,
      "end_seconds": 208.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "650 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.24,
      "end_seconds": 214.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.98,
      "end_seconds": 233.54,
      "duration_seconds": 17.56,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago. My husband and I live above the shop. I retired from the post office two years ago. I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.11,
      "end_seconds": 252.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.97,
      "end_seconds": 269.55,
      "duration_seconds": 15.58,
      "text": "yes, high cholesterol i've got high blood pressure i've been putting this off for weeks i did try to ignore it for a while i've got an irregular heartbeat"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.61,
      "end_seconds": 276.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.96,
      "end_seconds": 280.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.47,
      "end_seconds": 299.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "I can't feel your spleen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.66,
      "end_seconds": 318.68,
      "duration_seconds": 14.02,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Okay, thinking it through, it fits best with an enlarged gland with night sweats that needs a proper work-up. A blood condition is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.72,
      "end_seconds": 322.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, uh, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.48,
      "end_seconds": 335.2,
      "duration_seconds": 10.72,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an enlarged gland with night sweats that needs a proper work-up is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.55,
      "end_seconds": 362.37,
      "duration_seconds": 18.82,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a chest X-ray because of night sweats it's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture keep a note of your temperature each evening right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.46,
      "end_seconds": 366.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.55,
      "end_seconds": 368.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "look after yourself"
    }
  ]
}